IMPORTANT GAMEPLAY ISSUES (NEEDS FIXING!)
==================================================================

 => RAIN SHOULD NOT CONFLICT WITH ANYTHING (i.e. "out" sound should not
 stop rain sound from playing!)

basic user experience testing results:
 * Fix "hit area" for racket -> make outside areas also hit the ball or
                                add a sound to make it audible that the
                                ball hit the edge area of the racket.
                                 COLLISION DETECTION BEI RACKET!!!
 * Give a visual clue where the ball goes when serving

 * AI is currently broken
   "Satz vom sportlichen Statistiker" (add statistics features to AI)


